{:fh/id  "FH-SUB-007"
 :fh/law "Capture is same-render-thread only: a read with no active render is refused, and on a host that can convey a binding into a child thread a forked read is refused BEFORE it probes, so a fork records nothing."

 :query [:shell/v]

 :outside-render-error-id :rf.error/view-read-outside-render
 :forked-error-id         :rf.error/view-forked-capture

 ;; The render thread's own read is the only site in the capture.
 :recorded-sites 1}
